d{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nFinally, $$\n\\displaystyle P=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"] [17592186547315 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1.14 & 0.02 \\\\ 0.02 & 0.72\\end{bmatrix}"] [17592186547320 :answer/value "\\frac{1}{144}\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 11\\end{bmatrix}"] [17592186547324 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 6\\end{bmatrix}"] [17592186547326 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{5} & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\frac{51}{80}\\end{bmatrix}"] [17592186547337 :answer/value "\\frac{1}{144}\\begin{bmatrix}11 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 11\\end{bmatrix}"] [17592186547357 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0.16 & 0.07 \\\\ 0.07 & 0.24\\end{bmatrix}"] [17592186547361 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -0.4 \\\\ -0.4 & 4.3\\end{bmatrix}"] [17592186547380 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0.17 & -0.05 \\\\ -0.05 & 0.42\\end{bmatrix}"] [17592186547386 :answer/value "\\frac{1}{144}\\begin{bmatrix}11 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 11\\end{bmatrix}"] [17592186547387 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -5 \\\\ -5 & 5\\end{bmatrix}"] [17592186547389 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0.32 & -1.4 \\\\ -1.4 & 0.16\\end{bmatrix}"] [17592186547390 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{5} & -\\frac{2}{5} \\\\ -\\frac{2}{5} & \\frac{11}{40}\\end{bmatrix}"] [17592186547409 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0.3 \\\\ 0.3 & 2.16\\end{bmatrix}"] [17592186547412 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -5 \\\\ -5 & 6\\end{bmatrix}"] [17592186547422 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{5} & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\frac{23}{40}\\end{bmatrix}"] [17592186547425 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{18} & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\frac{8}{75}\\end{bmatrix}"] [17592186547437 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -0.1 \\\\ -0.1 & 4.3\\end{bmatrix}"] [17592186547447 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{2}{45} & \\frac{5}{63} \\\\ \\frac{5}{63} & \\frac{67}{548}\\end{bmatrix}"] [17592186547464 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 4\\end{bmatrix}"] [17592186547468 :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0.21 & -0